In Python, what is the output of this binary search?
def bs(arr, t): l, r = 0, len(arr)-1;
while l <= r: m = (l+r)//2;
if arr[m] == t: return m;
elif arr[m] < t: l = m+1;
else: r = m-1;
return -1;
print(bs([1, 2, 3, 4], 3))

